{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102120","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410212001:1":{"text":"フリンさん、ちょうどいいところに！鉱洞の方で何かあったのか、原料の一部が今になってようやく届いたんだ！","source_cn":"弗林，你来得正好！今天矿洞那边不知道出了什么问题，原料...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0889B6778264E238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410212002:1":{"text":"けど、すでに仕事を振り分けちまったから、運ぶ人がいなくて……製錬所が原料を待ってるってのに……","source_cn":"目前人都已经安排开了，根本没有空余人手来运这批，但冶炼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE882118F2FD65FBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410212003:1":{"text":"なんだと！？鉱洞で何かあるはずなど……ああ、分かったぞ！","source_cn":"咦？！不应该啊，矿洞的人怎么会……啊，我知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4684E504E056AA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410212004:1":{"text":"歓迎会の準備にダストを呼んだのだ、恐らくそのせいで手違いがあったのだろう。","source_cn":"这真是，今天安排欢迎仪式的时候把老灰给叫过去了，估计是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EA0986AE11D883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410212005:1":{"text":"理由がなんであれ、こっちの作業に支障が起きてるんだよ！","source_cn":"不管哪边的岔子，现在的东西可不能耽搁了，弗林！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE1A65E835C92851","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410212006:1":{"text":"仕事のことになると、相手が誰だろうと気にしないのは、どこのドワーフさんも同じですね。","source_cn":"说到干活一点也不客气了，这才是我们熟悉的矮人嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B66004CC16CDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410212007:1":{"text":"村長、我々が来たせいで問題が起きているようだな。よければ力を貸すぞ。","source_cn":"弗林村长，既然事情是因我们而起，不如我们也搭把手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFCC94815E5E3B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410212008:1":{"text":"ちょうど、この村の製錬技術を見てみたいと思っていたところだ。","source_cn":"正好，我也想见识见识贵地的冶炼工艺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1326D402B663976B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410212009:1":{"text":"いやいや……特使様のお手を煩わせるわけには……","source_cn":"不行不行……哪能让耀光特使来干这些脏活儿累活儿？多不好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57E9A598283BAB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410212010:1":{"text":"フリンさん！もうそういうのはいいから！さっきから製錬所の催促がひっきりなしなんだよ！","source_cn":"弗林！别客套了！冶炼所那边又又又又在催！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9A953F3F9742145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410212011:1":{"text":"ううむ……しかし、客人に仕事をさせるわけには。至急人員を手配するから少し待て！","source_cn":"呃……我立刻安排更多人手！一定不能让尊贵的客人参与生产——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB356634277BD73D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410212012:1":{"text":"遠慮することはない。これも視察の一環だと思って、我々に任せてくれ。","source_cn":"弗林村长，别客气。就让我们来吧，就当是参观环节的一部分了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE67BB26078CC56D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410212013:1":{"text":"ですが……分かりました。特使様の仰せのままに。","source_cn":"这……一切听特使您的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C2466C18395A7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠铁须":{"text":"職人のハガルド","source":"工匠铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗林":{"text":"フリン","source":"弗林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"ホーガン","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":4}}